From 8204158ef06f8306c1ad55a9cae3c60e05264881 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Russell
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:23:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SCRATCH (experimental, off by default; to be dropped): single
 postponement queue prototype
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

STITCHWORT_QUEUE=1 queues record literals and .field on an unknown type in
the main pass (docs/proposals/postponement.md draft 2, §11), with resume
points switched by STITCHWORT_QUEUE_APP/_LIFT/_SCOPED and the field-name rule
at the literal by _NAMES_FIRST. crates/driver/tests/queue_scratch.rs and
dev/queue-prototype/ measure it. Not for merging.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
